---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ResumePreview from '../components/ResumePreview.astro';
import {reactiveTemplates} from '../data/templates';
---
<Layout title="Resume Templates, Examples & Free Career Tools" description="Build your next resume with free templates, job-specific examples, and practical writing guides. Edit privately in your browser and download PDF or DOCX."><div class="home-wrap">
<div class="page-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE <span class="edition">A little ambition goes a long way.</span></div>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR EXPERIENCE. YOUR STORY.</span><h1>Good on paper.<br/><span>Unforgettable</span><br/>in person.</h1><p>You’ve got the potential. Let’s put it on paper.<br/>Create a resume that opens doors to what’s next.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button primary" href="/builder/">Build my resume <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="button secondary" href="/templates/">Explore templates</a></div><div class="hero-facts"><span>✓ Free to get started</span><span>✓ No sign-up needed</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="hero-outline"></div><div class="hero-resume"><ResumePreview/></div><div class="float-note note-top"><span class="spark-box">✦</span><div><strong>A little more you.</strong><small>A lot more possibility.</small></div></div><div class="float-note note-bottom"><span class="check-disc">✓</span><div><strong>Ready for your next move</strong><small>Clean. Confident. Unmistakably you.</small></div></div><span class="art-star star-one">✳</span><span class="art-star star-two">✦</span></div></section>
<div class="benefit-strip"><span><Icon name="check"/> Designed for easy reading</span><span><Icon name="spark"/> Words when you need them</span><span><Icon name="download"/> PDF, JSON & text exports</span><span><Icon name="folder"/> Your data stays yours</span></div>
<section class="section templates-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A FIRST IMPRESSION THAT LASTS</span><h2>Resume templates that fit your next move<span class="pink">.</span></h2><p>Different styles. Same main character energy.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/templates/">All templates <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><div class="filter-row" data-home-filters><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">For you</button><button class="filter" data-filter="professional">Professional</button><button class="filter" data-filter="modern">Modern</button><button class="filter" data-filter="creative">Creative</button><button class="filter" data-filter="simple">Simple</button><span class="filter-end">A fresh start looks good on you.</span></div><div class="template-grid home-templates">{['onyx','azurill','chikorita','ditto'].map((id,i)=>{const t=reactiveTemplates.find(t=>t.id===id)!;return <a href={`/builder/?template=${t.id}`} class="template-card" data-category={t.category}><div class:list={['template-stage',`stage-${t.id}`]}>{i===0&&<span class="template-badge">REACTIVE RESUME</span>}<img class="upstream-preview" src={`/templates/${t.id}.jpg`} alt={`${t.name} resume template`} loading="lazy" width="600" height="848"/><span class="template-use">Use this template ↗</span></div><div class="template-caption"><div><h3>{t.name}</h3><p>{t.description}</p></div></div></a>;})}</div></section>
<section class="tool-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">MORE THAN A RESUME</span><h2>Your ambition.<br/>Our toolkit.</h2></div><a href="/cover-letter/"><Icon name="mail"/><strong>Cover letter builder</strong><span>Make the introduction count. ↗</span></a><a href="/checker/"><Icon name="check"/><strong>Resume checker</strong><span>A second look. A stronger resume. ↗</span></a></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESS OVERTHINKING. MORE OPPORTUNITY.</span><h2>From blank page to next chapter.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/builder/">Let’s do this <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><div class="steps-grid">{[['01','Find your fit','Pick a template that matches your personality and your next role.'],['02','Tell your story','Add your experience, find the right words, and make it yours.'],['03','Make your move','Download your finished resume and send it out with confidence.']].map(([n,title,desc])=><div><span class="step-number">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></div>)}</div></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Find the right starting point</h2><div class="topic-links"><a href="/resume-builder/">Free online resume builder</a><a href="/templates/finance/">Finance resume template</a><a href="/templates/registered-nurse/">Nurse resume templates</a><a href="/advice/skills-to-put-on-resume/">Skills to put on a resume</a><a href="/advice/resume-length/">How many pages should a resume be?</a><a href="/advice/">Resume advice</a></div></section><section class="home-bottom"><span>YOUR FUTURE DOESN’T WRITE ITSELF.</span><h2>Let’s give it a great opening.</h2><a class="button primary" href="/builder/">Create my resume <Icon name="arrow"/></a></section><footer class="footer"><span>Small steps. Big possibilities.</span><span>Built for the next version of you. © {new Date().getFullYear()} resumv</span></footer>
</div></Layout>
